t("- special ghoul talents: ghoulish leap, gnaw and retch", "- 特殊食尸鬼技能：定向跳跃、啃噬和腐秽呕吐", "_t")
t("The rotting bodies of ghouls also force them to act a bit more slowly than most creatures.", "食尸鬼腐烂的身体同时使它比别的生物行动要慢一些。", "_t")
