t("A strange grey growth on the dungeon floor.", "地板上的奇特灰色植物。", "_t")
t("brown mold", "棕色霉菌", "entity name")
t("A strange brown growth on the dungeon floor.", "地板上的奇特棕色植物。", "_t")
