t("It is a ghostly apparition with a humanoid form.", "它有着人类的脸孔，幽灵般的影子。", "_t")
t("grave wight", "墓穴尸妖", "entity name")
t("It is a ghostly form with eyes that haunt you.", "它呈幽灵形态，眼睛一直盯着你。", "_t")
